#: ../../source/docs/debug-with-send-text.rst:5
#: e876ba01e65241618eee3614286408ab
msgid "Debugging with send_text"
msgstr "使用 send_text 进行调试"

#: ../../source/docs/debug-with-send-text.rst:7
#: 05077435c07a4bf7819eedce302a7cd7
msgid ""
"A simple way to send small short debug messages (50 characters or less) to "
"the ground station is to use `GCS_MAVLink::send_text() "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/GCS_MAVLink/GCS.h#L112>`__."
"  Data sent in this will will appear on the ground station's HUD and "
"messages area."
msgstr ""
"向地面站发送简短调试信息（50 个字符以内）的简便方法是使用 `GCS_MAVLink::send_text() "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/GCS_MAVLink/GCS.h#L112>`__。发送的数据将显示在地面站的"
" HUD 和消息区域。"

#: ../../source/docs/debug-with-send-text.rst:9
#: 59ef148d415147c09d9fc33c818c019a
msgid ""
"At the top of the file in which you wish to do the print include "
"GCS_MAVLink.h/GCS.h"
msgstr "在需要打印信息的文件顶部，引入 GCS_MAVLink.h/GCS.h"

#: ../../source/docs/debug-with-send-text.rst:15
#: 05520a0d946f4008b8c793c215115f5d
msgid ""
"Then at the point in the code where the print should occur add the send_text"
" command"
msgstr "然后在代码中需要打印的位置添加 send_text 命令"

#: ../../source/docs/debug-with-send-text.rst:21
#: ff184618c3b34e95a86e937e83097db7
msgid ""
"In parts of the code where loops are running very quickly it may be "
"necessary to throttle the output"
msgstr "在循环运行非常频繁的代码段中，可能需要对输出进行限速"

#: ../../source/docs/debug-with-send-text.rst:35
#: f80ba342558648849122229f79a46629
msgid "here is a video illustrating this and yet another way to do it\""
msgstr "以下视频演示了这一方法及另一种实现方式\""
